<title>USA: Comair Holdings Feb load factor down.</title>
<headline>Comair Holdings Feb load factor down.</headline>
<dateline>CINCINNATI 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Feb 1997	  Feb 1996</p>
<p> Load factor - percent     52.3		55.7</p>
<p> Revenue passenger miles   117,233	   112,196</p>
<p> Available seat miles	224,426	   201,590</p>
<p>					    Year-to-date</p>
<p> Load factor - percent     55.8		53.7</p>
<p> Revenue passenger miles   1,407,117	 1,152,902</p>
<p> Available seat miles	2,522,633	 2,147,037</p>
<p>(Revenue passenger and available seat miles in 000s)</p>
<p>NOTES: Full company name is Comair Holdings Inc.</p>
<p>	     Year-to-date is fiscal.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 211 859-1610</p>
</text>
